    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d359">

                <pb facs="0527" n="425" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg425"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/2149: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Japan</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-03-11T18:00:00+09:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 11, 1919,
                                6 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received March 14,
                            5.30 a.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your telegram of February 21st, 4 p.m.<anchor n="77" xml:id="d359-f1"/> Vice
                    Minister for Foreign Affairs advises me that his Government has entrusted to the
                    Japanese financial group the working out in the first instance in consultation
                    with the other groups of the technical details of their cooperation in China
                    business.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacMurray</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
